WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.650
Let's give this Golf its own web page, with a QR card for the windscreen. Easy peasy.

2
00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:11.709
Open the car from your stock, and pick the Car Passport tab.

3
00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:19.929
Switch on Live on the web. Buyers see the photos, the price and the details, but never what you paid.

4
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:28.457
Add what you've done to it, in your own words, and a friendly note from you. No prices, just the good stuff.

5
00:00:31.117 --> 00:00:38.117
Save it, and there's your QR code. Print a card for the windscreen, or copy the link and send it to a buyer.

6
00:00:40.276 --> 00:00:48.296
And this is what buyers see when they scan it: the photos, the MOT history and your note, right there on their phone.

7
00:00:50.302 --> 00:00:52.702
Done! Now go and sell that Golf.
